cowriter (4.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add private offline spelling and common grammar underlines.
  * Add local poetry and prose tools with the bundled CMU dictionary.
  * Add personal readings, rhyme maps, repetitions, reference cards and notes.
  * Add formatted exports and desktop sharing with Writer, PDF and mail apps.
  * Open document arguments from the desktop launcher without losing drafts.
  * Hand off articles and linked evidence reports to Open Pressroom.
  * Build with PEP 517 and run the regression suite during packaging.
  * Document installer downloads, checksums, upgrades and private user data.

