cowriter (4.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Major rewrite: Co-Writer v4 with Documancy.
  * Multi-tab editor with file browser sidebar.
  * Adaptive panes: hide AI first, then Files/Notebook on smaller windows.
  * Header pane toggles, compact document actions, and responsive toolbars.
  * Save feedback, close protection, recovery copies, and workspace memory.
  * Keyboard shortcuts, Find/Replace, and full native Markdown preview.
  * Cancellable AI activity, research stages, and background model discovery.
  * Guided assistant tasks and explicit Check claims & sources workflow.
  * Selectable Europe PMC, arXiv and OpenAlex search with source provenance.
  * Markdown formatting toolbar and preview.
  * Zettelkasten notebook with [[wikilinks]] and backlinks.
  * Model auto-detection and configurable AI model selector.
  * Import/export: TXT, MD, HTML, PDF, DOCX, ODT, EPUB, MOBI, RTF.

